## How to restart

{% if s.kind == "container" and s.compose_project %}
From the folder with its compose file on **{{ s.host }}**: `docker compose -p {{ s.compose_project }} restart {{ s.compose_service }}`
{% elif s.kind == "container" %}
On **{{ s.host }}**: `docker restart {{ s.name }}`
{% elif s.kind == "manual" %}
{{ s.restart_hint or "No restart instructions yet. Add `restart:` to this entry under `manual_services` in the config." }}
{% elif s.kind == "vm" %}
In the Proxmox web UI, or on node **{{ s.host }}**: `qm reboot {{ s.vmid }}`
{% else %}
In the Proxmox web UI, or on node **{{ s.host }}**: `pct reboot {{ s.vmid }}`
{% endif %}
